                    by Kocher and approved by Robertson.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d474-f2" n="2" xml:id="d474-f2-content">
                <p>A brief memorandum of conversation on this meeting by Robertson is <hi rendition="#italic">Ibid.</hi>,
